// CORRECT - comprehensive analysis and simultaneous fixes
// Identify: rate limiting + schema + processing order + validation ALL AT ONCE
```

### ❌ Never Ignore Infrastructure Error Patterns
```javascript
// WRONG - assuming test logic is broken when seeing consistent errors
